33.58, "end": 236.58, "text": "OK, how are we going to divide the--"}, {"start": 236.58, "end": 240.3, "text": "hey, what-- hey, Todd, buddy!"}, {"start": 240.3, "end": 241.14, "text": "You pass the test!"}, {"start": 244.14, "end": 246.38, "text": "You're walking might be a long time, sir."}, {"start": 246.38, "end": 247.74, "text": "A long time."}, {"start": 247.74, "end": 249.7, "text": "I've kept my head down, paid my dues,"}, {"start": 249.7, "end": 252.3, "text": "and well, I think I'm ready to make detective."}, {"start": 252.3, "end": 253.82, "text": "You've only been here a month."}, {"start": 253.82, "end": 255.74, "text": "You really haven't done much of anything."}, {"start": 255.74, "end": 258.94, "text": "And there's no such thing as security guard detective."}, {"start": 258.94, "end": 261.16, "text": "- We don't solve crimes."}, {"start": 261.16, "end": 263.1, "text": "We barely prevent them."}, {"start": 263.1, "end": 264.54, "text": "- You wanna detect something?"}, {"start": 266.14, "end": 267.34, "text": "Do it on your own time."}, {"start": 270.5, "end": 271.5, "text": "- Maybe I will."}, {"start": 272.5, "end": 274.44, "text": "- Maybe I will."}, {"start": 275.34, "end": 279.62, "text": "My own words rang in my head like a bell inside a head."}, {"start": 279.62, "end": 281.1, "text": "Maybe I was crazy."}, {"start": 281.1, "end": 283.82, "text": "Or maybe, just maybe."}, {"start": 283.82, "end": 285.06, "text": "I was a detective."}, {"start": 285.74, "end": 287.74, "text": "Hey!"}, {"start": 287.74, "end": 288.74, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 288.74, "end": 289.74, "text": "Looking for something?"}, {"start": 289.74, "end": 290.74, "text": "No."}, {"start": 290.74, "end": 293.74, "text": "She said she wasn't, but her eyes said otherwise."}, {"start": 293.74, "end": 297.74, "text": "She was all dame, legs that went all the way to the bottom of her torso."}, {"start": 297.74, "end": 299.74, "text": "The kind of arms that had elbows."}, {"start": 299.74, "end": 300.74, "text": "Um..."}, {"start": 300.74, "end": 303.74, "text": "Did you just call me in here to stare at me?"}, {"start": 309.74, "end": 314.74, "text": "The way she left, I could tell that somebody, or something, had really put the scare on her."}, {"start": 315.74, "end": 317.82, "text": "But what? Why?"}, {"start": 317.82, "end": 319.34, "text": "Stapler."}, {"start": 319.34, "end": 320.82, "text": "Was it crazy?"}, {"start": 320.82, "end": 323.62, "text": "Or are they somehow connected?"}, {"start": 323.62, "end": 324.62, "text": "Can't believe it."}, {"start": 324.62, "end": 327.38, "text": "This is the first time there hasn't been a beetle in here."}, {"start": 327.38, "end": 328.86, "text": "Should we move outside?"}, {"start": 328.86, "end": 330.42, "text": "Uh-huh."}, {"start": 330.42, "end": 331.94, "text": "Did you been here when I said?"}, {"start": 331.94, "end": 332.54, "text": "Uh-huh."}, {"start": 332.54, "end": 333.82, "text": "Seriously?"}, {"start": 333.82, "end": 335.66, "text": "Is this what it's going to be like working together?"}, {"start": 335.66, "end": 336.62, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 336.62, "end": 339.14, "text": "The last three followers?"}, {"start": 339.14, "end": 340.86, "text": "People just can't have a little treat about Ben Sherman's"}, {"start": 340.86, "end": 341.62, "text": "winter collection."}, {"start": 345.54, "end": 348.18, "text": "roommates, study group, lab partners."}, {"start": 348.18, "end": 349.82, "text": "We really are gonna spend all our time together."}, {"start": 349.82, "end": 350.94, "text": "How awesome is that?"}, {"start": 350.94, "end": 352.42, "text": "- Mary. - You know what else is awesome?"}, {"start": 352.42, "end": 353.7, "text": "Last night I saw the Hong Kong movie"}, {"start": 353.7, "end": 354.9, "text": "that \"Kick Punch\" is based on."}, {"start": 354.9, "end": 356.66, "text": "- Yeah, I know. I was there."}, {"start": 356.66, "end": 357.62, "text": "- Did you see the scene where \"Kick Punch\""}, {"start": 357.62, "end": 359.54, "text": "are \"Kick Punch\" is 200 guys with one kick punch?"}, {"start": 359.54, "end": 361.14, "text": "- Yeah. Both of 'em."}, {"start": 363.54, "end": 364.38, "text": "- Oh."}, {"start": 365.14, "end": 366.98, "text": "We spent too much time together."}, {"start": 366.98, "end": 367.82, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 367.82, "end": 369.06, "text": "- Jinx."}, {"start": 369.06, "end": 370.74, "text": "- You used to have been with this cupcake?"}, {"start": 370.74, "end": 371.82, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 371.82, "end": 373.06, "text": "And here he is a few seconds later"}, {"start": 373.06, "end": 374.74, "text": "when he was crying because he dropped his cupcake."}, {"start": 374.74, "end": 375.74, "text": "- (laughs)"}, {"start": 375.74, "end": 377.74, "text": "And here we use another cupcake."}, {"start": 377.74, "end": 379.74, "text": "Oh wait, these pictures are the same cupcake."}, {"start": 379.74, "end": 384.24, "text": "- Oh, Shirley, these pictures are adorable and comprehensive."}, {"start": 384.24, "end": 386.74, "text": "But did you know that sugar is like baby meth?"}, {"start": 386.74, "end": 388.74, "text": "That's what my homeopaths said."}, {"start": 388.74, "end": 390.74, "text": "- Well, maybe yo gay French and mine is on business."}, {"start": 390.74, "end": 392.74, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 392.74, "end": 395.74, "text": "- Forget about the girl I told myself."}, {"start": 395.74, "end": 397.74, "text": "Let her go."}, {"start": 397.74, "end": 401.74, "text": "Like a lobster claw letting go of a small balloon for lobsters."}, {"start": 401.74, "end": 404.34, "text": "Still, I had a hunch."}, {"start": 404.34, "end": 406.18, "text": "Mm."}, {"start": 406.18, "end": 407.54, "text": "Matchbook."}, {"start": 407.54, "end": 409.98, "text": "Something about it seemed clued."}, {"start": 409.98, "end": 412.82, "text": "Arizona Matchbook Company."}, {"start": 4