text": "- The hair color concept intrigues me"}, {"start": 529.42, "end": 530.9, "text": "because it's how I distinguish you anyway."}, {"start": 530.9, "end": 531.94, "text": "But what if we arrange by age"}, {"start": 531.94, "end": 533.02, "text": "so that way the young people can work"}, {"start": 533.02, "end": 534.82, "text": "while the old people sleep and vice versa?"}, {"start": 534.82, "end": 536.66, "text": "- I was just wondering who you considered old"}, {"start": 536.66, "end": 539.1, "text": "because I'd like to remind you again"}, {"start": 539.1, "end": 541.18, "text": "that I'm just about the same age as Jeff."}, {"start": 541.18, "end": 542.18, "text": "- Well, I was counting Jeff as old too."}, {"start": 542.18, "end": 543.02, "text": "- Hey."}, {"start": 543.02, "end": 544.18, "text": "- Oh, well, that's all right then."}, {"start": 544.18, "end": 547.18, "text": "I just don't understand how my age has anything to do."}, {"start": 547.18, "end": 549.22, "text": "Oh, for heaven's sake, Pierce."}, {"start": 549.22, "end": 551.34, "text": "I was thinking the thing that would be most beneficial,"}, {"start": 551.34, "end": 553.66, "text": "you know, for the group, would be to pair the people"}, {"start": 553.66, "end": 556.18, "text": "with the lowest GPAs with the highest."}, {"start": 556.18, "end": 557.62, "text": "Hmm, interesting."}, {"start": 557.62, "end": 559.66, "text": "The highest carrying the lowest."}, {"start": 559.66, "end": 561.26, "text": "I can see how you might want that."}, {"start": 561.26, "end": 562.76, "text": "You know what, Annie?"}, {"start": 562.76, "end": 565.1, "text": "Pew, pew, pew, pew."}, {"start": 565.1, "end": 567.94, "text": "Wait, no, pew, pew, pew, pew."}, {"start": 567.94, "end": 568.78, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 568.78, "end": 570.42, "text": "Does anyone else have kids"}, {"start": 570.42, "end": 572.9, "text": "because I have a gorgeous little newborn"}, {"start": 572.9, "end": 573.74, "text": "that I'd like to get help?"}, {"start": 573.74, "end": 576.18, "text": "Perfect, you'll enjoy talking to Shirley about her kids."}, {"start": 576.18, "end": 579.02, "text": "Uh-uh, don't go trying to pon Todd off on me."}, {"start": 579.02, "end": 580.26, "text": "Again, none taken."}, {"start": 580.26, "end": 583.06, "text": "Guys, our terrariums are due tomorrow, and it's already nine."}, {"start": 583.06, "end": 585.7, "text": "OK, let's make this simple and do it like student housing."}, {"start": 585.7, "end": 588.98, "text": "Everyone write down their lab partner preferences from one to eight."}, {"start": 588.98, "end": 589.78, "text": "Abed?"}, {"start": 589.78, "end": 590.66, "text": "You're a computer?"}, {"start": 590.66, "end": 593.02, "text": "You figure out a way to put us in our optimal pairings."}, {"start": 593.02, "end": 595.98, "text": "And before you all go putting Todd down last,"}, {"start": 595.98, "end": 598.34, "text": "don't forget he comes with a turtle."}, {"start": 598.34, "end": 599.74, "text": "You're halfway done."}, {"start": 599.74, "end": 600.3, "text": "How does that sound?"}, {"start": 603.14, "end": 604.34, "text": "Somebody wake up, Pierce."}, {"start": 604.34, "end": 606.22, "text": "Hello, Arizona Matchbook Company."}, {"start": 606.22, "end": 608.7, "text": "I had to get some answers, and I needed answers"}, {"start": 608.7, "end": 610.26, "text": "like a fish needs a bicycle."}, {"start": 610.26, "end": 611.1, "text": "A lot."}, {"start": 611.1, "end": 612.5, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 612.5, "end": 614.9, "text": "Yeah, I am interested in your matchbooks."}, {"start": 614.9, "end": 616.26, "text": "Would you like to place an order?"}, {"start": 616.26, "end": 618.94, "text": "I had to think fast."}, {"start": 618.94, "end": 619.58, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 619.58, "end": 620.9, "text": "Get away from my desk."}, {"start": 620.9, "end": 621.78, "text": "I'll call you back."}, {"start": 621.78, "end": 623.14, "text": "You've been walking around campus,"}, {"start": 623.14, "end": 625.46, "text": "asking people weird questions, and then staring at them"}, {"start": 625.46, "end": 627.06, "text": "while slightly moving your lips."}, {"start": 627.06, "end": 628.38, "text": "I had to think fast."}, {"start": 628.38, "end": 629.5, "text": "No."}, {"start": 629.5, "end": 634.02, "text": "- Man, I think this job might be getting to you."}, {"start": 634.02, "end": 636.26, "text": "I think you need to take some time off."}, {"start": 636.26, "end": 638.1, "text": "- Well, you'd like that, wouldn't you?"}, {"start": 638.1, "end": 639.1, "text": "- Very much so."}, {"start": 640.34, "end": 641.66, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 641.66, "end": 643.22, "text": "- All right, yep."}, {"start": 643.22, "end": 645.18, "text": "According to my system, Anne is gonna be with Shirley."}, {"start": 645.18, "end": 646.9, "text": "Pierce is with me, Troy's with Britta,"}, {"start": 646.9, "end": 647.94, "text": "and Jeff is with Todd."}, {"start": 647.94, "end": 650.14, "text": "- Okay, let's get to work."}, {"start": 650.14, "end": 653.82, "text": "- Wait, how did I end up with Todd?"}, {"start": 653.82, "end": 655.14, "text": "I mean, no offense, but he wasn't exactly"}, {"start": 655.14, "end": 656.34, "text": "at the top of my list."}, {"start": 656.34, "end": 657.18, "text": "- None taken?"}, {"start": 657.18, "end": 658.1, "text": "- That's what the algorithm dictated."}, {"start": 658.1, "end": 659.5, "text": "- And we're just supposed to trust your algorithm."}, {"start": 659.5, "end": 660.46, "text": "- You're questioning my algorithm?"}, {"start": 660.46, "end": 661.3, "text": "- Not necessarily."}, {"start": 661.3, "end": 662.62, "text": "Is your algorithm above questioning?"}, {"start": 662.62, "end": 663.46, "text": "- Not necessarily."}, {"start": 663.46, "end": 664.86, "text": "- Will you just tell us how you chose?"}, {"start": 664.86, "end": 666.46, "text": "- I used the balance to rank everyone by popularity"}, {"start": 666.46, "end": 668.3, "text": "and I put the most popular with the least popular."}, {"start": 668.3, "end": 669.34, "text": "I figured it would maximize each"}, {"start": 669.34, "end": 670.38, "text": "partnership's audience appeal."}, {"start": 670.38, "end": 671.7, "text": "- Oh, I see."}, {"start": 671.7, "end": 673.62, "text": "So I was number one and he was obviously number eight."}, {"start": 673.62, "end": 674.46, "text": "No offense to us."}, {"start": 674.46, "end": 675.98, "text": "- You and Todd were four and five."}, {"start": 675.98, "end": 677.42, "text": "- I was four."}, {"start": 677.42, "end": 678.26, "text": "- Todd was four."}, {"start": 678.26, "end": 679.1, "text": "- I was five?"}, {"start": 679.1, "end": 680.18, "text": "Well that's insane."}, {"start": 680.18, "end": 681.58, "text": "We don't even know him."}, {"start": 681.58, "end": 682.66, "text": "He's a stranger."}, {"start": 682.66, "end": 683.7, "text": "- Geez, Chef."}, {"start": 683.7, "end": 685.14, "text": "It has feelings."}, {"start": 685.14, "end": 687.34, "text": "- Wait, so we all know Annie was number one"}, {"start": 687.34, "end": 689.78, "text": "because she'd do all the work."}, {"start": 689.78, "end": 692.9, "text": "And Shirley was her partner, so..."}, {"start": 692.9, "end": 695.62, "text": "- What that means, you all put..."}, {"start": 695.62, "end": 696.82, "text": "I just worked it out."}, {"start": 698.06, "end": 700.48, "text": "I'm more popular than someone."}, {"start": 702.94, "end": 704.78, "text": "- Getting the matchbook shipped to me the same day"}, {"start": 704.78, "end": 706.26, "text": "wasn't easy."}, {"start": 706.26, "end": 708.1, "text": "I had to pay the company money."}, {"start": 708.1, "end": 709.54, "text": "I used New Year's as card."}, {"start": 710.42, "end": 712.74, "text": "He thanked me at the detective awards."}, {"start": 712.74, "end": 716.54, "text": "Somewhere, somehow, I was gonna find what I was looking for."}, {"start": 717.34, "end": 720.1, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 730.88, "end": 733.38, "text": "- Merry mother of God."}, {"start": 733.38, "end": 736.66, "text": "Was I crazy or was I on the verge of something?"}, {"start": 736.66, "end": 740.34, "text": "My mind real with thoughts, voices, stand of premises."}, {"start": 740.34, "end": 742.22, "text": "Why don't they just make tires out of pavement"}, {"start": 742.22, "end": 743.42, "text": "so you can drive on anything?"}, {"start": 743.42, "end": 744.26, "text": "- What's up with buttons?"}, {"start": 744.26, "end": 746.62, "text": "- What would happen if Nicholson was a gynecologist?"}, {"start": 746.62, "end": 749.62, "text": "There was something there. I need a notepad."}, {"start": 749.62, "end": 751.62, "text": "Maybe a blazer."}, {"start": 754.62, "end": 757.62, "text": "Honey, I don't know when I'll be home."}, {"start": 757.62, "end": 760.62, "text": "How could you guys hate me more than peers?"}, {"start": 760.62, "end": 762.62, "text": "Or anything more than peers?"}, {"start": 762.62, "end": 764.62, "text": "Then I, Shirley, my friends and I,"}, {"start": 764.62, "end": 766.62, "text": "are not gonna let you drive a wedge between us."}, {"start": 766.62, "end": 768.62, "text": "Shirley has a point."}, {"start": 768.62, "end": 770.62, "text": "This list stinks like a butt convention."}, {"start": 770.62, "end": 773.62, "text": "How else could you explain Troy being so unpopular?"}, {"start": 773.62, "end": 776.96, "text": "Uh, I think I was the popular one in our pairing."}, {"start": 776.96, "end": 778.96, "text": "Oh, Troy."}, {"start": 782.46, "end": 784.5, "text": "Fine, why don't I just go work with Todd."}, {"start": 784.5, "end": 787.8, "text": "Hey, that's cool. Whatever gets this project done."}, {"start": 787.8, "end": 790.3, "text": "Oh, wow. What a great guy."}, {"start": 790.3, "end": 792.64, "text": "I can see why all of you like him so much more than me."}, {"start": 792.64, "end": 796.24, "text": "Jeff, maybe it's just that no one wants to carry you all year."}, {"start": 796.24, "end": 799.48, "text": "Gee, you're right, Annie. It's not personal."}, {"start": 799.48, "end": 801.08, "text": "I mean, it's not like people really like you."}, {"start": 801.08, "end": 802.98, "text": "You're just a good grade and a tight sweater."}, {"start": 802.98, "end": 805.62, "text": "- Well, you're just a bad grade and a tight sweater."}, {"start": 805.62, "end": 807.32, "text": "And who the hell are you always texting?"}, {"start": 807.32, "end": 808.78, "text": "Everyone you know is here."}, {"start": 808.78, "end": 810.72, "text": "- Okay, let's all just take a breath."}, {"start": 810.72, "end": 812.66, "text": "- Don't get your number four stink on this Todd."}, {"start": 812.66, "end": 814.06, "text": "Okay, let's focus."}, {"start": 814.06, "end": 817.86, "text": "We're all the same people we were 12 hours ago."}, {"start": 818.86, "end": 820.66, "text": "Maybe we should just revert to our original pairings."}, {"start": 820.66, "end": 822.4, "text": "- But I thought you didn't wanna carry Jeff."}, {"start": 822.4, "end": 823.9, "text": "Oh, well, you just don't wanna work with Shirley."}, {"start": 823.9, "end": 826.46, "text": "- (gasps) You too, Brute."}, {"start": 826.46, "end": 828.1, "text": "- It's just..."}, {"start": 828.1, "end": 829.84, "text": "You're a creationist. - What?"}, {"start": 829.84, "end": 831.24, "text": "- You're so religious!"}, {"start": 831.24, "end": 834.84, "text": "How are you gonna do science experiments if you don't even believe in science?"}, {"start": 834.84, "end": 838.24, "text": "Just because someone's religious doesn't mean they have a problem with science,"}, {"start": 838.24, "end": 842.24, "text": "and certainly if an introductory biology course at a community college"}, {"start": 842.24, "end": 844.74, "text": "can refute 2,000 years of miracles."}, {"start": 844.74, "end": 845.74, "text": "Oh, God!"}, {"start": 845.74, "end": 846.74, "text": "And what about Britta?"}, {"start": 846.74, "end": 848.24, "text": "She's not gonna dissect anything."}, {"start": 848.24, "end": 851.24, "text": "Fine, you got me. I won't dissect anything with a face."}, {"start": 851.24, "end": 852.24, "text": "What about worms?"}, {"start": 852.24, "end": 854.24, "text": "They have tiny little faces."}, {"start": 854.24, "end": 856.24, "text": "This is why you're the stupidest."}, {"start": 856.24, "end": 858.74, "text": "It's loving worms is stupid. I don't want to be smart."}, {"start": 858.74, "end": 861.24, "text": "It is! And you can't be!"}, {"start": 861.24, "end": 863.44, "text": "Guys, I just figured it all out."}, {"start": 863.44, "end": 865.34, "text": "Pierce, wake up. Jeff is gonna heal us."}, {"start": 865.34, "end": 867.94, "text": "We have been looking at this totally wrong."}, {"start": 867.94, "end": 870.74, "text": "There's no way I'm unpopular."}, {"start": 870.74, "end": 873.04, "text": "One of you monsters just put me last"}, {"start": 873.04, "end": 875.04, "text": "in a petty attempt to humble me."}, {"start": 875.04, "end": 878.04, "text": "Oh, I just had a terrible nightmare"}, {"start": 878.04, "end": 880.04, "text": "that Jeff was a pompous ass."}, {"start": 880.04, "end": 881.64, "text": "Also, Todd was there."}, {"start": 881.64, "end": 883.64, "text": "Uh, no offense, Todd."}, {"start": 888.74, "end": 891.48, "text": "[dramatic music]"}, {"start": 892.58, "end": 894.78, "text": "I poked my nose where it didn't belong."}, {"start": 894.78, "end": 897.28, "text": "Someone, or something,"}, {"start": 897.28, "end": 898.92, "text": "sent me a message."}, {"start": 900.42, "end": 904.16, "text": "Veronica, it's my fault she got mixed up in all this."}, {"start": 904.16, "end": 905.92, "text": "[gasping]"}, {"start": 905.92, "end": 907.92, "text": "- Do I have to-- - Mom?"}, {"start": 907.92, "end": 911.46, "text": "Ah, ah, ah, Todd, pretty sure I heard a fire alarm."}, {"start": 911.46, "end": 913.2, "text": "Nobody's going home until we see those ballots."}, {"start": 913.2, "end": 915.1, "text": "See the ballots? Are you crazy?"}, {"start": 915.1, "end": 917.44, "text": "I say, let's lay our cards in the table"}, {"start": 917.44, "end": 919.68, "text": "and see what everyone really thinks of each other."}, {"start": 919.68, "end": 921.08, "text": "Get behind me, Obet."}, {"start": 921.08, "end": 922.68, "text": "(SCREAMING)"}, {"start": 922.68, "end": 924.44, "text": "Jack, stop it!"}, {"start": 924.44, "end": 925.44, "text": "- This! - Get me!"}, {"start": 925.44, "end": 926.44, "text": "- No! - Get back!"}, {"start": 926.44, "end": 929.08, "text": "- Get back! - I'm doing this for all of us."}, {"start": 929.08, "end": 930.48, "text": "Oh, no, she's got her mirror."}, {"start": 930.48, "end": 931.68, "text": "- Why don't I-- - Don't!"}, {"start": 931.68, "end": 933.08, "text": "- Oh! - Whoa!"}, {"start": 933.08, "end": 934.32, "text": "- No! - Oh!"}, {"start": 934.32, "end": 936.32, "text": "The turtle is in there!"}, {"start": 936.32, "end": 939.16, "text": "- Oh, my God! - I'm so sorry!"}, {"start": 939.16, "end": 942.16, "text": "What is wrong with you, people?"}, {"start": 943.6, "end": 944.6, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 946.04, "end": 949.04, "text": "I thought you were supposed to be friends!"}, {"start": 949.04, "end": 952.04, "text": "I thought you were supposed to love each other!"}, {"start": 953.54, "end": 958.04, "text": "Your love is weird and toxic"}, {"start": 958.04, "end": 961.04, "text": "and it destroys everything it touches!"}, {"start": 961.04, "end": 964.04, "text": "I no longer care about grades,"}, {"start": 964.04, "end": 969.04, "text": "or biology, or finally graduating from college"}, {"start": 969.04, "end": 972.04, "text": "like I promised my dying father."}, {"start": 973.04, "end": 975.04, "text": "I'm going home."}, {"start": 976.04, "end": 978.5, "text": "I'm gonna hold my wife and my child close,"}, {"start": 978.5, "end": 982.54, "text": "and I am gonna finally take my insulin shot!"}, {"start": 984.5, "end": 986.04, "text": "A fence taken!"}, {"start": 989.18, "end": 990.18, "text": "A fence taken."}, {"start": 996.22, "end": 998.32, "text": "- Well, he is right about one thing."}, {"start": 998.32, "end": 1000.16, "text": "You're all terrible people."}, {"start": 1000.16, "end": 1001.86, "text": "And I don't care about the stupid assignment,"}, {"start": 1001.86, "end": 1002.86, "text": "I'm going home."}, {"start": 1002.86, "end": 1005.6, "text": "(gentle music)"}, {"start": 1005.6, "end": 1006.44, "text": "No, I'm not."}, {"start": 1006.44, "end": 1008.94, "text": "Going to biology class starts in 15 minutes."}, {"start": 1008.94, "end": 1009.94, "text": "[gasping]"}, {"start": 1013.14, "end": 1017.94, "text": "And eventually, this caterpillar will come out of its cocoon and then..."}, {"start": 1017.94, "end": 1019.62, "text": "Pop, pop!"}, {"start": 1019.62, "end": 1021.62, "text": "[cheering]"}, {"start": 1022.92, "end": 1024.62, "text": "Nice work, you two."}, {"start": 1024.62, "end": 1027.62, "text": "You know they're laughing at you, right?"}, {"start": 1027.62, "end": 1029.62, "text": "I mean, that's my theory."}, {"start": 1030.46, "end": 1032.46, "text": "Now, super group."}, {"start": 1032.46, "end": 1035.46, "text": "I can't help but notice the sorry lack of two areas."}, {"start": 1035.46, "end": 1038.46, "text": "We didn't have time to finish. Here's mine."}, {"start": 1038.46, "end": 1040.46, "text": "When did you even have time to do that?"}, {"start": 1040.46, "end": 1041.46, "text": "You're pathological."}, {"start": 1041.46, "end": 1043.46, "text": "It's too late for flattery."}, {"start": 1043.46, "end": 1046.46, "text": "Professor, obviously, this isn't working out."}, {"start": 1046.46, "end": 1048.46, "text": "You're just gonna have to put us with our original lab partners, all right?"}, {"start": 1048.46, "end": 1050.46, "text": "I don't have to do anything."}, {"start": 1050.46, "end": 1054.46, "text": "That after you broke my boy Todd, that man called me crying this morning."}, {"start": 1054.46, "end": 1056.46, "text": "You know, he fought in Iraq, right?"}, {"start": 1056.46, "end": 1059.46, "text": "We had a name for people like you in prison."}, {"start": 1059.46, "end": 1061.46, "text": "We called you the mean click."}, {"start": 1061.46, "end": 1063.46, "text": "But I have a solution."}, {"start": 1063.46, "end": 1065.46, "text": "All seven of you will share a microscope,"}, {"start": 1065.46, "end": 1068.46, "text": "one bench, and one grade that I will average."}, {"start": 1068.46, "end": 1070.46, "text": "Everyone else gets their own stuff."}, {"start": 1070.46, "end": 1072.46, "text": "So, can we get an extension on the first assignment?"}, {"start": 1072.46, "end": 1074.46, "text": "No. You all fell."}, {"start": 1074.46, "end": 1076.46, "text": "[door closes]"}, {"start": 1076.46, "end": 1078.46, "text": "Oh, oh."}, {"start": 1078.46, "end": 1080.46, "text": "Oh, my God!"}, {"start": 1080.46, "end": 1082.46, "text": "How did this happen?"}, {"start": 1082.46, "end": 1083.46, "text": "And did I miss the fireman?"}, {"start": 1083.46, "end": 1085.46, "text": "Dean, the explanation is simple."}, {"start": 1085.46, "end": 1087.46, "text": "It's all connected."}, {"start": 1087.46, "end": 1089.46, "text": "A web of conspiracy"}, {"start": 1089.46, "end": 1094.18, "text": "a conspiracy that goes all the way to the top of Arizona."}, {"start": 1094.18, "end": 1096.9, "text": "Oh, right."}, {"start": 1096.9, "end": 1099.98, "text": "Hey, somebody's been squatting in the utility closet."}, {"start": 1099.98, "end": 1103.34, "text": "There's a hard-played back there, thousands of matches."}, {"start": 1103.34, "end": 1106.42, "text": "I mean, we're looking at dozens of major health"}, {"start": 1106.42, "end": 1110.14, "text": "and fire-cold violations."}, {"start": 1110.14, "end": 1112.58, "text": "I think we're going to have to get the police involved."}, {"start": 1112.58, "end": 1114.46, "text": "And that's when it hit me."}, {"start": 1114.46, "end": 1117.38, "text": "I was in really big trouble."}, {"start": 1117.38, "end": 1118.22, "text": "- Me?"}, {"start": 1119.22, "end": 1120.04, "text": "- Me?"}, {"start": 1120.04, "end": 1121.96, "text": "- Uh, uh, no."}, {"start": 1123.06, "end": 1125.72, "text": "No need to get the cops with a conspiracy."}, {"start": 1125.72, "end": 1129.1, "text": "This big, they're probably involved."}, {"start": 1129.1, "end": 1129.94, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 1129.94, "end": 1133.16, "text": "- What Chang says makes a lot of sense and--"}, {"start": 1133.16, "end": 1134.2, "text": "- Okay, you know what?"}, {"start": 1135.16, "end": 1136.1, "text": "I quit."}, {"start": 1136.1, "end": 1138.5, "text": "I mean, I can deal with the not getting paid,"}, {"start": 1138.5, "end": 1141.98, "text": "but I draw the line that you enabling this man."}, {"start": 1141.98, "end": 1145.82, "text": "I mean, I'm seriously concerned that he's mentally you."}, {"start": 1145.82, "end": 1148.26, "text": "And it's not funny at all. It's scary."}, {"start": 1148.26, "end": 1148.78, "text": "The top number."}, {"start": 1148.78, "end": 1150.22, "text": "I needed to know more about those."}, {"start": 1150.22, "end": 1151.18, "text": "Are they very high, Mason?"}, {"start": 1151.18, "end": 1152.18, "text": "Were they ethnically distanced?"}, {"start": 1152.18, "end": 1153.02, "text": "I was."}, {"start": 1153.02, "end": 1154.38, "text": "Did they bring a dumb way?"}, {"start": 1154.38, "end": 1156.74, "text": "I was good by a calendar."}, {"start": 1156.74, "end": 1158.06, "text": "OK, screw this."}, {"start": 1158.06, "end": 1158.82, "text": "I quit."}, {"start": 1162.1, "end": 1164.1, "text": "Hmm?"}, {"start": 1164.1, "end": 1167.3, "text": "Well, it seems that Greendale owes you a debt of gratitude."}, {"start": 1167.3, "end": 1170.34, "text": "How would you like to be the new had a security?"}, {"start": 1170.34, "end": 1171.5, "text": "I had to think fast."}, {"start": 1171.5, "end": 1172.98, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 1172.98, "end": 1174.42, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 1174.42, "end": 1175.98, "text": "Was I crazy?"}, {"start": 1175.98, "end": 1178.62, "text": "Or was I just doing right by the school?"}, {"start": 1178.62, "end": 1180.62, "text": "[LAUGHING]"}, {"start": 1186.46, "end": 1187.96, "text": "Just easy moving your hands up."}, {"start": 1187.96, "end": 1189.06, "text": "[INTERPOSING VOICES]"}, {"start": 1189.06, "end": 1190.5, "text": "Just share it."}, {"start": 1190.5, "end": 1191.86, "text": "This is awkward, isn't it?"}, {"start": 1191.86, "end": 1192.94, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1192.94, "end": 1195.42, "text": "I think it's pretty clear what destroyed the balance"}, {"start": 1195.42, "end": 1197.02, "text": "in our study group's ecosystem."}, {"start": 1197.02, "end": 1198.7, "text": "Ranking one person above another."}, {"start": 1198.7, "end": 1200.62, "text": "Nothing more different to get the best of us."}, {"start": 1200.62, "end": 1201.66, "text": "Racism?"}, {"start": 1201.66, "end": 1202.66, "text": "No."}, {"start": 1202.66, "end": 1204.6, "text": "Todd."}, {"start": 1204.6, "end": 1205.6, "text": "Todd!"}, {"start": 1205.6, "end": 1207.1, "text": "What a so, Todd!"}, {"start": 1207.1, "end": 1208.6, "text": "You threw the head on that guy."}, {"start": 1208.6, "end": 1210.04, "text": "None taken."}, {"start": 1210.04, "end": 1211.24, "text": "What's wrong with him?"}, {"start": 1211.24, "end": 1213.64, "text": "Not to be un-Christian, but that boy so."}, {"start": 1213.64, "end": 1216.14, "text": "I missed this."}, {"start": 1216.14, "end": 1217.24, "text": "And his dumb baby."}, {"start": 1217.24, "end": 1218.84, "text": "What a son of a bitch."}, {"start": 1218.84, "end": 1219.84, "text": "Shut up."}, {"start": 1219.84, "end": 1220.84, "text": "Change your own."}, {"start": 1220.84, "end": 1221.84, "text": "I have to wait."}, {"start": 1221.84, "end": 1222.84, "text": "I have to wait."}, {"start": 1222.84, "end": 1223.84, "text": "Don't do this, Todd."}, {"start": 1223.84, "end": 1224.84, "text": "I'm sick of it."}, {"start": 1224.84, "end": 1225.84, "text": "Oh, my gosh."}, {"start": 1225.84, "end": 1226.84, "text": "It's stupid."}, {"start": 1226.84, "end": 1228.84, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 1228.84, "end": 1230.84, "text": "That was like, like, which one?"}, {"start": 1230.84, "end": 1231.84, "text": "Yeah, for y'all."}, {"start": 1231.84, "end": 1233.1, "text": "- Oh, look at it!"}, {"start": 1233.1, "end": 1234.1, "text": "- Don't worry, Tom."}, {"start": 1234.1, "end": 1234.94, "text": "- I'm like, \"Oh.\""}, {"start": 1239.38, "end": 1241.46, "text": "- These questions are really personal."}, {"start": 1241.46, "end": 1242.86, "text": "Are you sure this is anonymous?"}, {"start": 1242.86, "end": 1244.76, "text": "- Yeah, they're just practice evaluations"}, {"start": 1244.76, "end": 1245.96, "text": "for my psych class."}, {"start": 1247.9, "end": 1249.3, "text": "All right, who did a butt?"}, {"start": 1249.3, "end": 1250.78, "text": "- They're boobs."}, {"start": 1250.78, "end": 1251.62, "text": "And I don't know."}, {"start": 1251.62, "end": 1253.22, "text": "- Take it again."}, {"start": 1253.22, "end": 1255.82, "text": "All right, somebody drew a penis."}, {"start": 1255.82, "end": 1258.22, "text": "Oh, and another penis."}, {"start": 1258.22, "end": 1260.46, "text": "Penis, penis, penis."}, {"start": 1260.46, "end": 1261.82, "text": "Very mature, guys."}, {"start": 1261.82, "end": 1262.72, "text": "I didn't draw a penis."}, {"start": 1262.72, "end": 1263.82, "text": "You neither."}, {"start": 1265.76, "end": 1267.76, "text": "Yeah, these are all normally filled out tests."}, {"start": 1268.96, "end": 1270.96, "text": "Ha ha, gotcha."}, {"start": 1270.96, "end": 1274.56, "text": "This was also a test, and you all penist."}, {"start": 1274.56, "end": 1276.06, "text": "Past."}, {"start": 1276.06, "end": 1277.76, "text": "Maybe I need to take one."}, {"start": 1277.76, "end": 1279.56, "text": "A test, not a penis."}]}